{"id":"n29757-1-28","stage":1,"title":"흐르다 · 流","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29757-1-28-1","ko":"물속에 고기가 다 보인다!","zh":"水里的鱼全都看得见！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"물속에","meaning":"水中，水里","explanation":"물속：水中，水里；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"물속","audio":"/audio/82642e19bb103a0b2a60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56395","senseId":"1","lemma":"물속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고기가","meaning":"鱼","explanation":"고기：鱼；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"고기","audio":"/audio/645b9cec60f52032ad29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31685","senseId":"2","lemma":"고기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보인다!","meaning":"可见，看得到","explanation":"보이다：可见，看得到；ㄴ다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"3","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"82642e19bb103a0b","term":"물속","zh":"水中，水里","audio":"/audio/82642e19bb103a0b2a60.mp3","entryId":"56395","definition":"水的里面。","pronunciation":["물쏙"]},{"id":"645b9cec60f52032","term":"고기","zh":"鱼","audio":"/audio/645b9cec60f52032ad29.mp3","entryId":"31685","definition":"食用的鱼。","pronunciation":["고기"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"可见，看得到","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"某种结果出来。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/58518ff322f2c96d7aa4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29757-1-28-2","ko":"계곡에 흐르는 물은 맑고 깨끗해서 그래.","zh":"因为溪流里的水非常清澈干净。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"계곡에","meaning":"溪谷，山涧","explanation":"계곡：溪谷，山涧；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"계곡","audio":"/audio/c3f5d59dccc5ffe93501.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25645","senseId":"1","lemma":"계곡","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"흐르는","meaning":"流，流淌","explanation":"흐르다：流，流淌；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"흐르다","audio":"/audio/91dc8d3e5e85cc29b8fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29757","senseId":"1","lemma":"흐르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물은","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맑고","meaning":"清澈，明澈","explanation":"맑다：清澈，明澈；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"맑다","audio":"/audio/c8398a865a7478831698.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66031","senseId":"1","lemma":"맑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깨끗해서","meaning":"洁净，干净","explanation":"깨끗하다：洁净，干净；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"깨끗하다","audio":"/audio/653161c326427f17a781.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60323","senseId":"1","lemma":"깨끗하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c3f5d59dccc5ffe9","term":"계곡","zh":"溪谷，山涧","audio":"/audio/c3f5d59dccc5ffe93501.mp3","entryId":"25645","definition":"有水流过的山谷。","pronunciation":["계곡","게곡"]},{"id":"91dc8d3e5e85cc29","term":"흐르다","zh":"流，流淌","audio":"/audio/91dc8d3e5e85cc29b8fa.mp3","entryId":"29757","definition":"水等液体向低处流动或经过某一地点。","pronunciation":["흐르다"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"c8398a865a747883","term":"맑다","zh":"清澈，明澈","audio":"/audio/c8398a865a7478831698.mp3","entryId":"66031","definition":"由于没有掺杂脏乱的成分，十分洁净。","pronunciation":["막따"]},{"id":"653161c326427f17","term":"깨끗하다","zh":"洁净，干净","audio":"/audio/653161c326427f17a781.mp3","entryId":"60323","definition":"事物不脏。","pronunciation":["깨끄타다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/698bd9dc5f18b0094a6d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.19,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=29757","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":39,"sequenceScore":1.7421,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为溪流里的水非常清澈干净。","水里的鱼全都看得见！","这个房间有点冷呢。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["水里的鱼全都看得见！","这个房间有点冷呢。","因为溪流里的水非常清澈干净。"],"answer":2}]}
